[17.725131, "o", "## Decisions in force (1)\r\n\r\nEach was accepted, and none of them superseded. For the argument behind one, ask\r\n`read_record` for its id.\r\n\r\nNo other decision recorded here is awaiting a judgement.\r\n\r\n- **ADR-1 — Keep money as integer cents** · `01a0f7f0-3f3b-7000-b329-78d2284cc232`\r\n"]
[19.927047, "o", "\u001b[2m# and what the record can prove about itself — no key, no network\u001b[0m\r\n"]
