[21.664379, "o", "public: local integrity verified (T1/T2/T4); 1 tail(s); all events are signature-covered; 1 \r\nbackup key(s), which sign nothing until restored (see census — informational, not a break); \r\nexternal witness (T3): not covered — nothing outside this machine attests this record\r\n  census [backup-key] public \r\n3bb88e636d2c12351f583bd14c4aba36dd5a457d50edd3b821073499cdb1154a: the backup key this machine \r\nregistered for mnid:092fdaa10942529e480d04b761b273d0b6e285619686fc54c33b4913b80a8f84 — a \r\nbackup signs nothing until it is restored, so it has no tail (if it was restored and has \r\nsigned, that tail is not here)\r\nprivate: no record here — nothing has been written to this tree on this machine, so there \r\nis nothing to rule on\r\n"]
